-Preciptation may also affect community composition in short time scales. Exploratory models selected a positive association between rarefied richness and rainfall in the first days before collection using two datasets. Pulse-reserve theory predicts that rare rainfall can briefly release water limitation before drying restores it \cite{noymeir1973desert,schwinning2004pulse}. Dependence of the fitted association on a single wet spell in March 2023 makes independent storm events the appropriate unit for testing this prediction. Sampling before rain and during the first days of drying, together with measurements of cell abundance and activity, would distinguish growth from the detection of previously dormant cells.
